flowchart TD
  A["Method version proposed"] --> B["Validate immutable identity"]
  B -->|invalid| H["HOLD: identity or provenance gap"]
  B -->|valid| C["Resolve evidence references"]
  C --> D["Check reviewer independence"]
  D -->|same owner or unknown| H
  D -->|independent| E["Review verdict and outcome facts"]
  E -->|refuted or critical regression| R["REVISE"]
  E -->|partial, pending, or unknown| H
  E -->|all promotion facts explicit| P["PromotionCandidate recommendation"]
  P --> G["Existing repository dual gates"]
  G -->|pass + outcome verified| F["FA-ADE may promote"]
  G -->|pending or fail| H
  R --> L["Record reasons and lineage"]
  H --> L
  F --> L
